 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAlbion Components Ltd                         MASTER SERVICES\n                                              AGREEMENT\nUnit 7, Riverside Estate, BS1 5TR Bristol, United Kingdom\nVAT No: GB789088668\n\nFROM                                          BILL TO\n\nAlbion Components Ltd                         Westbrook Pharma Ltd\nUnit 7, Riverside Estate                      Unit 7, Riverside Estate\nBS1 5TR Bristol                               M1 2AB Manchester\nUnited Kingdom                                United Kingdom\nVAT: GB789088668\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 24/02/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Albion Components Ltd, with its registered office at Unit 7, Riverside Estate,\nBristol (\"Party A\"), and Westbrook Pharma Ltd, with its registered office at Unit 7, Riverside\nEstate, Manchester (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A   Albion Components Ltd / Amelia Clarke\n Party B   Westbrook Pharma Ltd / Harry Whitfield\n Date      24/02/2026",
